window.products.push({"id":314334,"name":"III Enstex Blackout Curtain Panels, Solid Thermal Insulated Room Darkening Grommet Top Drapes, Noise Reducing Energy Saving Light Blocking Drapes for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619vwhtfvCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Value Package: 2 panels of dark grey blackout curtains per package. Each panel measures 52x63 inches with 8 luxurious and elegant silver top grommets. Quality Material & Gorgeous Design: 220-230 GSM imported polyester material, thicker, softer, smooth touching, durable, no chemical odors. The silk soft fabric, aligned seams and hems, trimmed neatly edge, more suitable for realizing a dreamlike drape feeling. The stainless steel grommet with a diameter of 1.6 inches also allows you to slide freely and smoothly on standard curtain rods for vertical suspension, easy to install, ideal for farmhouse, bedroom, living room, kitchen, etc. True Blackout Drapes: The innovative triple weaving technology is applied in the fabric. The 3 layers including high density black yarn not only block 90-99% of the sunlight and UV rays (darker color works better), but also help to muffle the outside noise, and protect your privacy, perfect for baby naps, night shift workers, late sleepers, home decor, etc. Thermal Insulated: Our thermal drapes can balance the indoor temperature and cut down energy bills by insulating against summer heat and winter chill. Maintaining a comfortable ambient temperature in your room is conducive to energy conservation and the protection of upholstery and floor from color fading, perfect for bedroom, living room, kids room and nursery room. Easy Care: Hand or machine washable in gentle circulating cold water (below 86 F), quick ironing, steam clean, or tumble dry on low heat for long-term use, but do not bleach. Besides, although the wrinkles will fall out on their own over time, we recommend carefully using a steamer or dryer before hanging to remove some slight wrinkles caused by folding, further highlighting the beauty and improving your use experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619vwhtfvCL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"III Enstex","source_asin":"B099RHMRDB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-314334","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099RHMRDB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099RHMRDB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":314335,"name":"SAM + Ollie Hand Carved Decorative Artisan Wood Cutting Board, Cheese, Charcuterie Board, Serving Tray <p></p>","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818-qeUzjyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DESCRIPTION: Up your Charcuterie game with this beautiful, hand-carved Mango wood charcuterie board. Our boards provide an elegant and unique display for your assortment of meats, cheeses and fruits! Or showcase your sweet tooth with an by serving an assortment of cupcakes, cookies & macarons! This board can be used as a one of a kind display piece on it’s own, as an actual cutting board, serving tray, or for entertaining with of course - charcuterie. The board comes wrapped and boxed for protection during shipping. Our boards are food safe and easy to clean and maintain. Gently scrub your board with a sponge and hot soapy water using a mild unscented dish soap. Wash both sides of the board to prevent it from drying unevenly, which could cause the board to warp. (not dishwasher safe). Each handmade cutting board is approximately 17” tall, 8” wide and .5” thick. Features: DECORATIVE PIECE: This board looks beautiful all on its own. Stand it up behind your stove to showcase your backsplash, or in a grouping of multiple boards. Each cutting board is hand-carved and finished with a rustic, (food safe) light wood stain. All edges have been sanded and smoothed to prevent damage/scratching any table or surface. STYLED USE: Our boards provide an elegant and unique display for your assortment of meats, cheeses and fruits! Or showcase your sweet tooth with an assortment of cupcakes, cookies & macarons! Our boards are naturally water resistant and perfect for serving on the buffet or cocktail hour at your next party. Instantly add elegance to your celebrations; perfect for Mother’s Day, Baby Showers, Wedding Showers, Easter Dinner, Thanksgiving and Christmas! If you desire a more rustic look, you could easily add additional distressing with a quick swipe of sandpaper. DIMENSIONS: Carved cutting boards are approximately 17” tall, by 8” wide, by ½ inch thick. Our boards weigh less than 1.5 lbs. TABLE SAFE:","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818-qeUzjyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAM + OLLIE FURNISHINGS","source_asin":"B09Q7WM85J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-314335","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q7WM85J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q7WM85J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
