window.products.push({"id":314359,"name":"Brownie Pan with Dividers, Non-Stick Backing Pan, Brownie Pan, Lasagna Pan, Brownie Trays,18 Pre-slice Brownie Pan All Edges, Muffin and Cupcake Pan f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gn03nFYcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"AILELAN NON-STICK BAKEWARE The secret to perfect Non Stick Slice Solutions Brownie Pie Pan is the Slice Solutions Brownie Pan. This one-of-a-kind pan uses an ingenious metal divider to pre-slice brownies as they bake. Simply pour batter into the pan, insert the divider, bake and serve. There's no need to use a knife. Not only does the slice solutions brownie pan create flawless and uniformly sized brownies, but thanks to the metal divider, each brownie can be customized with nuts, candies, or any other toppings! The versatile pan is also ideal for making cornbread, crispy cereal bars, and any other baked treats. Features: 1)Combines non-stick, super strong surface 2)Mix your batter right inside the pan 3)Makes 18 perfectly sliced brownies 4)Each brownie easily pops out of the pan one by one 5)No coating with butter or oil, everything slides right off 6)Freezer and dishwasher safe 7)Durable and long-lasting Specifications: Dimensions: 2 inches (H) x 7.9 inches (W) x 12.2 inches (L)  The size of each part is 2” x 2.6” Included in the box: 1 x Divider insert, 1 x baking pan TIPS: We suggest that spray oil or grease the pan properly before use and it is easier to remove the brownies after cooling. 100% Satisfaction Guaranteed Our customers are our number one priority, which is why we make sure to deliver the best product possible.  If you have any questions about our product, you can contact our friendly customer service team and we will reply you within 24 hours.  If you are not delighted with your purchase, please feel free to contact us,we will refund your money within 30 days.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gn03nFYcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ailelan","source_asin":"B0C13JZLGW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-314359","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C13JZLGW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C13JZLGW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
