window.products.push({"id":314406,"name":"HOMOW Nonstick 14 Inch Heavy Duty Carbon Steel Pizza Tray Pizza Pan with Holes NS-S14 (14\" Square Pizza Pan)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619UYvxD2TL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The pan is made by special heavy duty carbon steel and characterized by high hardness and super endurance. Premium Whitford non-stick coating perfect demoulding. How to use - Wash before first use in warm. soapy water and dry thoroughly. - Metal and sharp kitchen tools should not be used as they may damage the non-stick coating. Wooden rubber heat-resistant nylon or plastic tools will be a good choice when baking. - Ensure product has cooled down around ten minutes prior to cleaning. - Never use heat above 450℉ and no any acidic food allowed when baking. - Do not place the product over direct heat or gas flame for a long time. Otherwise cake mold will be damaged. - Clean by dishwasher or hand washing with degertent. Do not use metal scourers or harsh abraasives to remove burnt-on food left in the pan. leave a soak for a few minutes in hot. Soapy water before starting to clean. Dry it by cloth or kitchen paper towel before storing. - This product is only suitable for oven. Please do not use it in microwave oven, electromagnetic oven or gas stove.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619UYvxD2TL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMOW","source_asin":"B07MJKNTQV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-314406","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MJKNTQV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MJKNTQV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
