window.products.push({"id":314541,"name":"NOVICA Metallic Decorative Recycled Metal Sculpture, 6.25\" Tall, Rustic Dj'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nHsCE1GhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer. About this item: Spinning tunes with melodic wonder, a DJ captures the imagination of Mexico's Armando Ramirez. He transforms a sparkplug and thick wires into the DJ's body, sculpting it into a vivid pose. Speaker protectors preserve their function, continuing to pose as speakers. All other pieces from the turntable are crafted with recycled metal sheets to achieve a life-like depiction of a DJ hard at work. - Each work is unique. Recycled parts will vary from piece to piece based on availability. - Features a rustic, rugged finish About our Artist: Born in a Mexican town famed for its traditional artistry, Armando Ramirez dreamed of creating something new. 'As a child I enjoyed inventing toys, and soon yearned to create a unique style of art. Environmentally enamored, I now transform recycled goods. I began to craft figures from scrap and discarded mechanical parts, mostly from cars and bicycles. Thanks to the creativity that God gave me, today I have an enjoyable and better way of life.'","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nHsCE1GhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B0082CK39Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-314541","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0082CK39Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0082CK39Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":314542,"name":"Perfect Stix Paint 12-50ct 12\" Wooden Paint Paddles (Pack of 50)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i618IeGfL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Perfect Stix PAINT12 paint Paddle stick is 12\" long, comes in a pack of 50 paddles, is made of biodegradable white birch wood that has been heat-treated to resist splintering, and is suitable for mixing or stirring paint and other liquids. It can be used for making hand-held signs and other crafts. Always follow paint-disposing procedures for sticks used with paints or other toxic substances. The paddle stick complies with FDA standards for food safety.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i618IeGfL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Perfect Stix","source_asin":"B01DYUK1DS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-314542","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DYUK1DS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DYUK1DS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":314543,"name":"ABEL CRAFTS Wicker Basket Organizer Rectangle Water Hyacinth Storage Baskets Set Of 4 Organizing Bathroom Bedroom Kitchen Shelves Pantry Natural Woven","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Pjc6xjSGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍀100% HANDCRAFTED: Water hyacinth storage baskets set of 4 for living room, bedroom, bathroom, shelves, dining table, kitchen storage shelves or home decor are masterfully hand-crafted by skilled artisans in a rural areas in Vietnam – the base of seagrass, bamboo, rattan and water hyacinth craftsmanship of Vietnam for the past 200 years - nestled 110 kilometers outside of Hanoi capital city. 🍀WIDELY USED: Water hyacinth storage baskets a solution to many storage needs, organizing and storing nursery products, clothes & underwear, socks, towels, toiletry storage, lady’s supplies, purse & accessories, magazine & books, files, supplies. Perfect display for Christmas, Thanksgiving, Halloween, wedding, party, and banquet. Outdoor and indoor use meet your different needs. 🍀EARTH-FRIENDLY: Wicker basket organizer are made of water hyacinth, a plant that’s sustainably grown and easy to harvest, reusable and biodegradable. Beside rattan, wood, seagrass, bamboo, water hyacinth now is widely used by artisans to make home decor furniture and accessories. It is a perfect choice for your family's health, a great eco-friendly and sustainable decor and serving solution 🍀STACKABLE & MULTIPLE USE: Whether it be by way of pure decor, storage or organisation for kitchen, pantry or bathroom, living room these Water hyacinth storage baskets suit your home in every way. They can stack on top of one another, closet or on shelves for efficient storage 🍀SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: We are committed to the highest level of quality every product water hyacinth storage baskets we make. By purchasing our eco friendly wicker basket organizer, you help thriving Vietnamese Artisan Communities, preserving indigenous crafts & cultures and promoting greater equity in world trade 🍀AN IDEAL CHRISTMAS OR BIRTHDAY GIFT: Hyacinth storage baskets for those setting up a home for the first time or a lovely gift for women who furnish their homes with personality and warmth. 🍀DIMENSIONS - LARGE DESIGN: The large basket measures 16.14 x 11.8 x 6.3 inches, the medium 14.6 x 10.24 x 5.7 inches, 2 small baskets 8.66 x 6.3 x 5.71 inches. Large and sturdy design for more storage and cute appearance will add a breath of natural vitality to your home, create a warm and simple living environment. 🍀DURABLE QUALITY - EASY TO CARE: The wicker baskets for storage use a wrapped metal frame, so it is extremely sturdy and prevents scratching. They are stackable for easier moving and saving your space. You can clean them with a damp and soft cloth, dry them in a cool place. 🍀A CLASSY FUSION OF UTILITY & DECOR: The classic appeal of a pantry organization and storage never goes out of style! with the creativity of the craftsman, the shape of the bins rectangle, the natural color of water hyacinth, and the size of the wicker, you've got yourself a stunning slice of ambience you can admire for years to come 🍀EASY ORGANIZATION: Eliminate the excess clutter by organizing items for easy access or storing them away in style. Multi use storage for any room, as a rustic nursery diaper caddy, closet organizer, storage cubes, bathroom basket, kids organizers and storage, decorative interior design pieces for display shelves, pantry, accessories storage, room storage, pet supplies, toy storage, office storage, clothing, or as a cute guest room amenities basket - from shelves to drawers to tables - the list of uses is endless for artistic, all-purpose, wicker storage bins like these","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Pjc6xjSGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ABEL CRAFTS","source_asin":"B09FHF7DJB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-314543","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FHF7DJB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FHF7DJB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
