window.products.push({"id":314572,"name":"32.8ft Fairy String Lights, Led Lights for Bedroom with App Controlled, RGB, Bluetooth, Music Sync, Indoor Twinkle Lamps for Window, Garland, Patio, G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vR6JlonfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✨ FAIRY RGB STRING LIGHTS WITH VARIEY CONTROLLER: Up to 16 millions dreamy colors, 20 scenes+ 4 music modes. Instead of only shows 1 color like normal lamp, Laliled fairy lights can change multiple colors at the same time like a magical rainbow in your bedroom. It toggled with multiple controllers - {Self Control Box, Remote Control, \"Hello Fairy\" App}. Convient to use and controll ✨ SYNC WITH YOUR MUSIC AT ANY TIME: Say goodbye to traditional monotonous pattern, our remote control fairy lights have 4 new smart musicmode: energy, rhythm, spectrum, scroll. The smart music LED fairy string light has a built-in highly sensitive Microphone. Smart fairy lights will sync with any music coming from the phone speaker or any other speaker in the room, providing you with the ultimate entertainment experience ✨ FLOWING LIGHTS EFFECT WATERPROOF STRING LIGHT: We adopted IC technology makes each bead on the whole string of lights show different colors at the same time, brighter than the traditional string light. IP44 waterproof rainbow light are perfect for bedroom, living room, gaming house, study, apartment, dorm, patio, garden, birthday, wedding, Halloween, Christmas and party decoration, etc. NOTE: Plz pay attention to the waterproof protection of the USB connector when using it outdoors ✨ SMART TIMING & MEMORY FUNCTION: Laliled multi-color changing lights ultilized timing and memory function, make you no need to worry about forgetting to turn off the light. The last mode and color settings are remembered when turned on again. What's more, you can personalize your schedule anytime, anywhere. The memory function will automatically save the mode you used before shutting down ✨ UP TO 10 GROUPS STRING LIGHTS CONTROLLED SIMULTANEOUSLY: To set up group control for all smart fairy lights and control them in 1 command, you can connect 1st fairy lights via APP and Bluetooth on the cellphone, then turn on the others lights and add them on the APP. Share your smart twinkle lights with family members in a minute ✨ USB POWERED & DIY FAIRY LIGHTS: The charge port are suitable for power bank, car charging, adapters, notebook computers, USB hubs, etc. Easy to use and carry, you can light up these lights colorful anywhere. These copper wire fairy lights outdoor can be DIY, folded into different shapes according to your needs, and can be easily wrapped around garlands, railings, and other places. Please note that the USB adapters are not included 👉 24+MONTHS WORRY-FREE AFTERSALE, 24H CUSTOMER SERVICES: Laliled provides 24+ months worry warranty and 30-days money back. Any questions, problems, issues about the fairy light, please do not hesitate to contact us via email or buyer central. Laliled support team always reply you within 24 Hours","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vR6JlonfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Laliled","source_asin":"B0BF8YSLNV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-314572","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF8YSLNV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF8YSLNV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":314573,"name":"AthLike Wall-Mounted Electric Fireplace, Recessed Low Noise Linear Heater, with Log&Crystal, Remote Control for Adjusting 1500W/750W, Time and Flame i","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611D82rBG4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"400 SQ FEET WARM: Electric fireplace can blow hot air from front vents for up to 1500W heating energy, whose heat outlet are located on the upper front area. Two-level heating (1500W & 750W) can heat up to 400 square feet room quite greatly, which is perfect for living room, bedroom or your dining room. Ideal for all kind of occasions, such as family home, bedroom, office, hotel lobby, club, or anywhere heat and ambiance is needed. 9-COLOR REALISTIC FLAME: Electric fireplace offers a realistic flame in full spectrum LED colors in 9 kinds and 5 flame level. Log set and crystal ember bed create realistic and colorful flame effects, but no traditional fireplace ashes and smoke. It can be operated just as a decorative fireplace without heating to provide the ambiance of a flame all year long. MULTI OPERATE MODES BY REMOTE CONTROL: Electric fireplace can be dual operated by remote control and touch screen. In the cold winter, you can easily control power heater from your bed.Temperature from 62℉ to 82℉ to suit your preference. Timer can be shut-off from 1H to 8H. 5 light intensities and 9-color flame can be easily changed with remote control. ENERGY SAVING: High power heater has 750W & 1500W modes， which can be adjusted accordingly for both warm and energy saving purpose. It can reduce your electric bill by using over 90% less energy than gas. SAFE&LESS DISTURBING: Electric fireplace has ETL Certificate Approved. High power heater is equipped with overheat protection, which will automatically cut off device once heater is overheating. WHISPER QUIET blower heating(≤40dB) can provide you a quiet environment when you are sleeping or watching book. Hidden touch screen design provides you with luxury experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611D82rBG4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AthLike","source_asin":"B09HHFHPVP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-314573","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HHFHPVP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HHFHPVP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
