window.products.push({"id":314598,"name":"4 PACK Lemon Lime Squeezer | Premium Quality Metal | Citrus Juicer Press | Manual Juice extractor | Yellow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c+v+xKuTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"ADVANTAGES Stronger than weak plastic alternatives & won’t bend like thinner stainless-steel juicers. Will never rust or peel.  No More Preservatives. Drink fresh-squeezed juice at any time and place without any chemicals.  Easy-to-use. The flesh section should face down while the peel section should face up.  The perfect size for squeezing lemons, limes and oranges with a minimal time and effort  Perfect size holes to allow all of the juice to be extracted yet none of the seeds or pulp will pass through  Incredibly comfortable and easy to use  Dishwasher safe and easy to clean  With a stainless steel ring for hanging/easy storage  7 holes in each bowl catch all seeds and pulp leaving clean fresh juice for use in drinks, cocktails, marinades, dressings, on grilled fish or meat.  Give your hand a break. Be efficient in the kitchen.  Do you have an electric-powered juicer that you never get out of the cupboard? Are you not getting enough juice out of your limes, lemons, oranges or other fruits? Are you getting seeds in your juice? Are you forced to use a reamer, a strainer or manually pick out pulp and seeds out of your juice or cocktail? If so, then this is the perfect product for you.  Relieves your hands from the strain of squeezing fruits manually.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c+v+xKuTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Marquee","source_asin":"B076MH2HRW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-314598","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076MH2HRW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076MH2HRW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
