window.products.push({"id":314680,"name":"Alata Potter 20-Piece Forged Silverware Set Stainless Steel Flatware Set,Service for 4,Matte Satin Polished Cutlery Set,Dishwasher Safe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ucB+vHpgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SILVERWARE SET INCLUDES:20-piece flatware set includes 4 dinner knife,4 dinner fork,4 dinner spoon,4 salad fork and 4 teaspoon,service for 4. FABRICATION:Crafted of high-performance 18/0 stainless steel with advanced hot forged process to strengthen durability and corrosion resistance. DESIGN AND APPEARANCE:Classic round handle shape with Satin finish, natural and elegant design.Smooth and silk surface without grain, easy to clean and care in daily use. Crafted forged process,strong and durable,so that the flatware set has a thicker texture. APPLICATION OCCASION:Suitable for family daily use,parties,gatherings,family dinners,candlelight dinner,banquet,camping,Thanksgiving,BBQ,wedding and other formal occasions. CARE INSTRUCTIONS:Dishwasher safe.Never needs polishing.Hand wash recommended,dry them before storing.Do not use steel wire brush,hard sponge,cleaning cloth or any other hard-material cleaning tools for cleaning to avoid damage to the silverware.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ucB+vHpgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alata","source_asin":"B09JJTQWFF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-314680","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JJTQWFF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JJTQWFF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":314681,"name":"Bamix Immersion Blender Set - DeLuxe - Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tnbL2-1sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This immersion blender set makes it easy to blend soups in the saucepan in an instant, make mayonnaise in less than 20 seconds, turn peanuts into peanut butter, and so much more. The DeLuxe blender reaches right into pots, bowls, and pitchers to purée soup, mix crêpe batter, and stir up lemonade in seconds. The versatile, compact 2-speed immersion blender delivers speeds between 10,000 and 15,000 RPM depending on the speed selected; use the low speed for light, airy dishes, and small amounts, or use the high speed for all viscous, firm ingredients and large amounts. The soft-grip handle offers a comfortable hold and more control while blending. The blender stand features an ultra-modern design and conveniently stores the blender and its attachments so that they are easily accessible. The stand be stored on the worktop or can be mounted on the wall. The blender blades included in the set cover a wide variety of food preparations tasks: use the multi-purpose blade to mince, chop, and purée raw and cooked vegetables, fresh fruit, cooked meat, and frozen fruit for ice cream and sorbets; the whisk blade stirs and creams pancakes, omelettes and batter mixtures, purées potatoes in no time at all, makes puddings creamy, emulsifies salad dressings â€“ and even cosmetic creams; and the beater blade can be used for preparing everything that should be light and fluffy â€“ egg whites, creams, soufflés, frappés, and more. The grinder grinds all kinds of dry food, such as dried vegetables, hard cheese, chocolate to stir into cake dough or to decorate your cakes, sugar to icing sugar, spices like cinnamon, vanilla, even nutmeg or chili for your Far Eastern dishes, dried mushrooms, all kinds of nuts, peanuts to peanut butter, grains and seeds. The grinder can be used to grind culinary herbs, boiled eggs, dried bread for making breadcrumbs â€“ even fresh bread for your stuffing, and much more. All parts that come into contact with food are made of top-quality rust-fre","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tnbL2-1sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"bamix","source_asin":"B001G5ZHWO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-314681","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001G5ZHWO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001G5ZHWO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
