window.products.push({"id":314852,"name":"Piper Lou | THIS IS PROBABLY VODKA, Stainless Steel Insulated Tumbler with Lid - Black | 20 Oz.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71el84Mk3FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUPERIOR QUALITY: Built with the highest quality materials, Piper Lou's Travel Mugs and Tumblers are versatile, reusable, powder coated, 100% BPA and lead-free. Our tumblers are double-walled and vacuum insulated for maximum benefit. PRACTICAL DESIGN: Piper Lou's Wine Glasses for Women has a unique wide-mouth design, and stainless-steel rim makes for easy drinking without spillage. MULTIPLE USES: Piper Lou's fun and versatile travel mugs are the perfect Stainless-Steel Cups for all types of drinks. Ideal Wine Glasses for both indoor and outdoor. The possibilities are simply endless! TONS OF CHOICES: Life isn't one size fits all, and neither is your Insulated Wine Tumbler. Choose from 30 and 20 oz. sizes and pick your favorite color from our wide selection of fun, quirky and stylish Tumbler Cups. PERFECT GIFT FOR ALL OCCASIONS: Whether it's a Birthday, Christmas, Valentines or Mother's Day our unique Wine Tumbler with Sayings for Women is the ideal choice for BFFs, Moms, Sisters, Aunts, Co-Workers, Teachers, Nurses, Grandmas, Nanas, Cousins, or any fabulous woman including yourself.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71el84Mk3FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Piper Lou","source_asin":"B07FWFPNYH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-314852","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FWFPNYH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FWFPNYH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":314853,"name":"BFloral Art, Wall Hanging Decorative Sculptures, Sunflowers, Roses, Indoor and Outdoor, Handmade in Haiti 13.5 x 14 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QcYkN-yqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This recycled metal sculpture has a protective coating. If your piece is displayed outdoors, however, it will wear off over time. To keep this sculpture looking the same as the day you bought it, take five minutes once a year to apply a clear spray-on enamel coating. It's a snap. Hanging your art is easy once you know how. Choose a point where the design element is joined or notched and use a nail to hang it from that point on the wall. Use a second and a third nail (if necessary) within other design elements to straighten and secure the piece. Then stand back and admire your work. You'll see that the nails \"disappear\" into the sculpture. Beautiful! The Haitian method of creating sculptures originated over 6o years ago and has changed very little in that time. Outside each workshop are stacked 55 gallon drums, waiting to be prepared. Apprentice artists and laborers cut off the tops and bottoms of the drums, fill them with straw and dry banana leaves, and then light them to burn out residues and strengthen the metal. When cooled, the drums are slit down the sides, pried apart, pounded flat with mallets, and vigorously sanded. At this point the artist takes over, chalking his intended design onto the metal. Using a hammer and chisel and other simple tools, the artist undertakes the intricate work of cutting, beading and detailing each piece. When he is finally satisfied with the results, he pounds his signature onto the sculpture and seals it up with a protective finish.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QcYkN-yqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"It's Cactus","source_asin":"B00N82YPZS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-314853","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00N82YPZS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00N82YPZS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
