window.products.push({"id":314990,"name":"Meat Thermometer, Instant Read Thermometer Cooking Thermometer Candy Thermometer with Super Long Probe for Kitchen Cooking BBQ Grill Smoker Meat Fry F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hqEMJz9pL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"A Thermometer You Can Carry On This is a nice, accurate and easy-to-use digital thermometer with a thin probe. Comes with a plastic sheath with pen clip, it safeguards the stem against any possible damage when not in use. The digital thermometer is handy to carry anywhere. Perfect for indoor kitchen and outdoor back yard barbecue activities. Sanitary Probe to Care Your Health The digital cooking thermometer is made of durable, easy-to-clean brushed stainless steel. And best of all, the probe is covered with a sturdy plastic cap so there is no risk of damaging it. Wide Temperature Range Gives a fast reading with a range from -50℃(-58ºF) to +300℃(572ºF), the meat thermometer is perfect for indoor use in the kitchen/fryer or outdoor use when grilling or smoking meats, fish or vegetables. You can also switch from ℃ to ºF for preferred read. Easy to Use Simply insert the long probe into your food / liquid and get perfectly cooked food every single time. The 4.6’’ stainless probe is long enough to keeps you from burning your hands while measuring. With very thin needle tip, it can get temperature more precisely and quickly. Important Notice 1.Clean the digital thermometer and probe with a damp cloth before and after use. 2.Do not submerse the unit in water or place it in dishwater. BE CAREFUL NOT TO GET WATER IN THE THERMOMETER AS THE TOP ELECTRONIC PART IS NOT WATERPROOF. 3.NEVER use the thermometer in a closed oven. Warranty The product includes a 30 days money back & 1 YEARS WARRANTY.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hqEMJz9pL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Thriving Life","source_asin":"B07D37DTBP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-314990","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D37DTBP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D37DTBP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":314991,"name":"HUMIDIER Portable Car Humidifiers, Cool Mist Small Humidifiers, USB 7 Color Night Lights Waterless Auto Shut-Off Quiet Humidifier for Personal Travel ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ySWj5KNhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【One Button Control】Portable USB small humidifier is easy to operate,One button control of all functions.You just need to press the power button every 1 second to control the mist.Press and hold the power button for 3 seconds to turn on the colorful atmosphere light.(Warm tip: Soak the cotton swab in water for 3-5 minutes for the first use, and then put it in the catheter) ✅【Double Nozzle Double Moisturizing】The small humidifier has dual nozzles , 2 spray modes , and has a dual humidification effect than the traditional single nozzle humidifier . Single spray mode can last up to 7 hours ; The dual spray pattern lasts up to 4 hours . Built-in water level sensor , When the water level is below the set minimum , it will automatically turn off the power . And strong sealing , no longer afraid of accidental dumping of liquid leakage . ✅【Silent Ultrasonic Humidifier】The small humidifier produces a near-silent frequency of 25dB (quieter than a library ) , create a quiet environment , Bringing you a good night's sleep and a distraction-free work environment . 7-color soft night lights , create a sweet and romantic sleep atmosphere , improve sleep quality ! ✅【Spray switching mode】Short press the power button to turn on the spray switching mode, at this time it is the dual spray mode (white indicator light is on ). Short press again to switch to single spray mode. The single spray method can be divided into left fog and right fog. 300ml water tank capacity can produce longer mist. The detachable water tank is convenient for you to add water for cleaning . (Note : do not add essential oils to the water tank) ✅【Wireless And Rechargeable】Portable and compact design makes it very convenient for you to carry around, with built-in 2500mah large capacity battery for long battery life. The USB power adapter is compatible with any USB port of the device, ensuring it can be used in the bedroom, office, car and bathroom. 1 year warranty! If you have any questions or concerns, please feel free to contact us for assistance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ySWj5KNhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HUMIDIER","source_asin":"B09QM54LYJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-314991","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QM54LYJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QM54LYJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
